    <string name="wifi_check_ethernet">This TV is on a wired connection — the best there is. If mirroring still stutters, the weak side is your iPhone or iPad\'s Wi-Fi.</string>
    <string name="wifi_check_offline">This TV doesn\'t seem to be on Wi-Fi right now.</string>
